  "description": "*\"Even if I eat poison three times a day instead of rice, I won't die?\"*\n\nNo matter how hard he tries, he won't die, the immortal saint. Finally succeeded in dying... I thought it was just a day, but he turned out to be a third-rate bodyguard of Han Gi-Ru in Shandong Province? But his powerful internal energy from the past is still dormant within him. The endless strife in the martial arts world, the secret struggles of the princes surrounding the throne, and the evil Taoist path acting secretly behind it all. The third-rate bodyguard Cheongpung stands against all this chaos.To make matters worse, enemies with whom he had a grudge from the past begin to show up one after another, and the confusion reaches its peak. Will he be able to regain the martial arts skills from his days as a saint and finally reach nirvana?\n\nIn 2025, the grand drama of the imperial palace that tears the martial arts world apart begins!!\n\n(Source: Mr.Blue, translated)",
